<title>SPAIN: Asturiana posts 9-month 2.70 bln pta loss.</title>
<headline>Asturiana posts 9-month 2.70 bln pta loss.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Asturiana del Zinc for the nine months to end-September in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Attributable loss		    2.70     vs    0.923</p>
<p> Pretax loss			    2.69     vs    0.954</p>
<p> Ordinary profit			1.89     vs    1.08 loss</p>
<p> Net operating profit		 3.15     vs    0.849</p>
<p> Total value of production	 41.87     vs   43.25</p>
</text>
